juist is a peer-to-peer mesh VPN with no coordination server. WireGuard
carries the traffic, and who belongs to the network is a log signed by
its admins.

This plugin runs juistd on the firewall, has the ruleset call juist's pf
anchors, opens its ports, shows the network's devices, and can hold an
admin key to invite and remove devices from the GUI.

The juist package itself comes from juist's own repository and is not a
dependency of this plugin: https://github.com/nning/juist

